<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-PORTUGAL DRAW 1-1 WITH ALBANIA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTUGAL DRAW 1-1 WITH ALBANIA.</headline>
<dateline>AVEIRO, Portugal 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal drew 1-1 with Albania (halftime 0-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group nine qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Portugal - Ricardo Silva 77-pen</p>
<p>Albania - Edi Martini 47</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
</text>
